    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Layer coverage and attribution",
      "description": "This map distinguishes collected signals from uninstrumented layers; shared host metrics are not presented as per-domain measurements.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 28,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 9
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "sis-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "| Layer | Coverage | Signals |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Public edge | **Measured** | HTTPS availability, HTTP status, DNS, TLS, and response phases. |\n| Application/API | **Measured** | SIS route response and unauthenticated session guard. |\n| Data dependencies | **Measured** | Authenticated PostgreSQL SELECT 1 and SIS app/session/cache Redis PING checks. |\n| Host services | **Measured** | Nginx, OpenLiteSpeed, SIS API service, and shared host resource metrics. |\n| SIS workflows | **Measured** | Dev keep-alive groups are environment-wide signals, not admin-domain-attributed checks. |"
      }
    },
